<rdfs:comment>- Establishing and monitoring of organizational arrangements to support deployment and operation of new and/or modified service infrastructure;
- Creating, deploying, modifying and/or upgrading of service infrastructure deployment support tools (including service Inventory) and processes for new and/or modified service infrastructure;</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

