<rdfs:comment>- Monitoring capacity utilization of deployed service infrastructure to provide early detection of potential service infrastructure shortfalls;
- Monitoring of, and reporting on, service infrastructure and resource instance currency and version management;</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/ProcessModel_v1#Optimize Existing Service Infrastructure Utilization -->

