<rdf:label>Create Business Partner Interaction Log</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The purpose of this process is to create a record that logs the Business Partner interaction. The Business Partner interaction can be initiated by the Business Partner or by the enterprise.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

