<rdf:label>Update Business Partner Interaction</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The purpose of this process is to update the Business Partner interaction, typically when additional action is carried out during long-lived interactions. When the Business Partner should be notified about the update, this process triggers the Notify Business Partner process to perform the notification.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

